ith 1 automatic success.<br /> <br /> Samiel spends a willpower to increase his defense to 3<br /> <br /> 9 2 4 7 8 8 10 1 10 9 3 7 - Reroll 1 to 1 reroll 1 to 2 for 10 success; granting 6 thresholds allowing Katsuko to carry all three damage from Fire And Stones Strike, giving her total <b>decisive </b>damage pool of 15 dice. 6 2 3 3 5 9 1 7 4 8 4 4 7 8 2 - for 5 levels of Lethal <b>decisive</b> damage, leaving Samiel at his last -2 helath box due to the effects of the Pain Tolerance Merit</span></span></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Katsuko\u2019s blade strikes true, rending a massive gash through the articulation joining Samiel\u2019s torso plates and the lower half of his armour. Blood splatters to the ground as she flicks her wrist, sending the last trace of her opponent\u2019s first blood to the ground from her blade.</span></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">End of turn, both characters gain 5m<br /> <br /> Katsuko\u2019s Turn at 3i.</span></span></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Katsuko\u2019s pause is long enough for the wind to catch the length of her hair, slightly askew from the exertion. But the Courtier does not relent, she shifts again, drawing her blade right back along the same line, this time cutting from left to right; her caste mark suddenly flashing back into view, as if it had only briefly paused to ponder the gravity of the moment.</span></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Katsuko declares, a <b>decisive </b>Strike and activates </span></span><i>Excellent Strike<